{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119171902288-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119181332\"/><p>事主昏迷送院救治。（陳嘉順攝）</p><p>西貢發生單車意外。今午(19日)4時39分，3名男子結伴到西貢踩單車郊遊，當他們由榕樹澳抵達深涌碼頭時，其中一名年約60歲男子不慎翻車，他倒地左眼角受傷，並陷入昏迷狀態，同行車友致電報案。救援人員接報趕往現場，政府飛行服務隊也派出直升機協助，並將事主吊起送往東區醫院搶救。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:23.075738+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:19:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T11:09:30.954538+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:44.186713+00:00","content_hash":"6abd7a5d705a667f88ed07f3abeff298f7edffa9284942a3002eb1326cdee8f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}